OL,3,CNew Zealand Football withdraws support
OL,4,Cfor Infantino
OL,6,FNew Zealand Football (NZF) has broken
OL,7,Franks with its Oceania confederation
OL,8,Fto withdraw support for Fifa president
OL,9,FGianni Infantino following his plan to
OL,10,Fsell off stakes in the men's World Cup
OL,11,Fto private investors.
OL,13,FIn a statement, it said decisions and
OL,14,Factions within Fifa had "contributed
OL,15,Fto a breakdown in trust" and called
OL,16,Ffor an independent review to restore
OL,17,Fconfidence in the sporting body.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/6
