OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F317A1787363309
OL,3,CNew Zealand Football withdraws support
OL,4,Cfor Infantino
OL,6,F"NZF believes this point in time
OL,7,Frepresents an opportunity for all Fifa
OL,8,Fmember associations to advocate for
OL,9,Fstronger governance, accountability
OL,10,Fand transparency which are fundamental
OL,11,Fin maintaining confidence of the
OL,12,Fadministration of the global game,"
OL,13,Fthe statement read.
OL,15,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,16,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,17,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,18,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/6
