OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F317A1787363309
OL,3,CNew Zealand Football withdraws support
OL,4,Cfor Infantino
OL,6,FThe Oceania Football Confederation
OL,7,F(OFC) had previously welcomed Fifa's
OL,8,Fdecision to withdraw the investment
OL,9,Fplan and its commitment to review the
OL,10,Fissues surrounding the project,
OL,11,Fwithout commenting on Infantino's role.
OL,13,F"OFC recognises the progress achieved
OL,14,Fover the last decade in advancing
OL,15,Ffootball development in Oceania under
OL,16,FFifa's leadership and encourages Fifa
OL,17,Fto use the review as an opportunity to
OL,18,Fidentify and implement any changes
OL,19,Fthat may be necessary," it said.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/6
