OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F317A1787363309
OL,3,CNew Zealand Football withdraws support
OL,4,Cfor Infantino
OL,6,FInfantino had previously seemed
OL,7,Fassured of continuing as Fifa
OL,8,Fpresident for another term before his
OL,9,FFifa Forward Enterprise (FFE) plan was
OL,10,Frevealed shortly after the 2026 World
OL,11,FCup finished, triggering global fury.
OL,13,FThe presidential election is scheduled
OL,14,Ffor March 2027, and no one has yet
OL,15,Fcome forward to publicly challenge him
OL,16,Fin the vote.
OL,18,FThe final date for candidates to enter
OL,19,Fthe election is November 18.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
