PN,31705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F317A1787363309
OL,3,CNew Zealand Football withdraws support
OL,4,Cfor Infantino
OL,6,FThe 211 national football associations
OL,7,Fthat make up Fifa have the power to
OL,8,Foust Infantino, with each country
OL,9,Fhaving an equal vote - and many have
OL,10,Falready made their position clear.
OL,12,FMultiple European nations like
OL,13,FFinland, England, Serbia, Germany,
OL,14,FDenmark, the Netherlands and Norway
OL,15,Fhave all publicly withdrawn their
OL,16,Fsupport from Infantino, as well as
OL,17,FJordan and New Zealand.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
