CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F317A1787363309
OL,3,CNew Zealand Football withdraws support
OL,4,Cfor Infantino
OL,6,FInfantino does still have a fair share
OL,7,Fof global support, however, with the
OL,8,Fheads of football federations in
OL,9,FMorocco, Qatar, Egypt, Mauritania,
OL,10,FLebanon and Sudan declaring their
OL,11,Fbacking on Thursday.
OL,13,FSri Lanka, Mexico, Bhutan, the
OL,14,FPhilippines, Indonesia, Argentina, and
OL,15,FParaguay have also said they are
OL,16,Fbehind him.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/6
